# "Another target creature": Arwen is not a legal target of her own ability, shown by a refusal that names her beside the
# positive control, the same activation targeting Ornithopter. Removing the indestructible counter is a cost, so once it is
# spent the ability cannot be activated again, even with another creature to target and {1} available.

